108
00:06:47.740 --> 00:06:52.600
Saudi -Araabia kroonprints Mohammed
bin Salman pöördus USA presidendi

109
00:06:52.600 --> 00:06:55.300
Donald Trumpi poole,
paludes USA otse rünnakuid Hutide

110
00:06:55.400 --> 00:06:59.600
